+// Site permissions (site_permissions, ABI 1.67): what Chromium holds for the
+// site of a tab's page, for the host's site information panel. The state is
+// Chromium's own (HostContentSettingsMap, the permission auto-blocker and the
+// device chooser contexts); nothing is kept here. The rules for what a site
+// "holds" and for a change follow components/page_info/page_info.cc
+// (PresentSitePermissions, ShouldShowPermission, OnSitePermissionChanged),
+// which needs a PageInfoUI and Browser UI the bridge does not have.
